{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人吳業坤、詹天文及林智樂等下午現身尖沙咀，出席慈善曲奇義賣活動，吸引大批粉絲到場支持。</p><p>剛因商演而「飛足成個月」的吳業坤表示開始籌拍攝新歌MV：「係自資出嘅第一隻歌，月中拍完MV，就等明年一月推出，自己都幾期待。</p><p>（自資用咗幾多錢？</p><p>）前前後後</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.614228+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T11:57:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"3224d69082035a7e0baf270840941ec056969467bbad055a389fac4f3400f3e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}